格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"openai models for login by chatgpt","id":"gh:1347283520","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-gpt-oauth","slug":"jiangliuhong/dsh-gpt-oauth","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"openai models for login by chatgpt"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-login-chatgpt"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that adds an `openai-codex-gptoauth` provider route and\nan independent **Cha"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"tGPT Login** settings page. The route mirrors the installed\n`openai-codex` catalog and uses Pi's off"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"icial ChatGPT OAuth device-code flow; no\nOpenAI API key is requested."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### Install from npm (recommended)"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"To install a specific version:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Package: <https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-login-chatgpt>"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Install from a local checkout (development)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The bundle installs the authorization service and uses the `llm` and\n`credentials` services supplied"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" by the standard `web` profile."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Start Harness:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Use"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Open **Settings → ChatGPT Login**.\n2. Select **Login with ChatGPT**.\n3. Open the displayed OpenAI"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" authorization URL and enter the one-time code.\n4. Wait until the settings page reports **Connected*"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"*.\n5. In the conversation composer click **Select model**.\n6. Click the **Model / Select model** row"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" to open the full catalog.\n7. Scroll to `openai-codex-gptoauth` and choose one of its GPT models."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The route appears in the conversation model selector, not on the **Models**\nsettings page."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The login grant is stored by the DSH credentials service under\n`llm-pi-ai/openai-codex-gptoauth`. Mo"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"del requests reuse that grant and its\nrefresh flow automatically. OAuth tokens are never returned to"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" the browser;\nonly login status, the verification URL, and the one-time device code are\nshown."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Local login endpoint"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The client bundle talks to a loopback-only helper on `127.0.0.1:3091`. The\nhelper accepts browser re"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"quests only from loopback origins. A port conflict\nfails plugin startup rather than silently disabli"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ly from loopback origins. A port conflict\nfails plugin startup rather than silently disabling login."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Development checks"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Release"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Set the version in `package.json` and `package-lock.json`, commit it, then push a\nmatching tag. Both"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" `0.2.0` and `v0.2.0` tag forms are accepted:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The tag workflow runs checks, publishes the exact `package.json` version to npm\nwith provenance, and"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" creates a GitHub Release through npm Trusted Publishing\n(OIDC). After the initial package bootstrap"},{"id":"p27s3","text":", no npm token or local publish is\nneeded for subsequent releases."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
